  "task": {
    "objective": "Contain two spreading fire fronts while preserving at least one of three shared assets, using finite water, temporary firebreaks and teammate transfers.",
    "natural_termination": "Success when all fire lifetimes are zero and at least one asset survives; failure when all three assets have zero integrity. The shared per-step reward is success minus failure minus total new asset damage divided by 16. Otherwise truncate at step 96.",
    "interaction": "Building blocks partners' movement and fire transmission at the same physical cells. Using the depot consumes finite supplies available to others. Handing water to an adjacent teammate enables later suppression or construction. Firebreak erosion and depleted fuel determine future spread.",
